OL,4,CPlan for 120 homes in village set to   
OL,5,Cbe refused                             
OL,6,GPlans to create up to 120 homes on the 
OL,7,Gedge of a village in Leicestershire    
OL,8,Gare set to be turned down as the area  
OL,9,Ghas a "limited range of services and   
OL,10,Gfacilities".                           
OL,12,FBlaby District Council's planning      
OL,13,Fcommittee is recommended to refuse a   
OL,14,Fplanning application on Thursday from  
OL,15,FMaxi Property Developments to build    
OL,16,Fthe development on land north of       
OL,17,FLeicester Road, Sharnford.             
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
