OL,4,CCat to get new nostril - then          
OL,5,Chopefully a new home                   
OL,6,GA cat is set to get an unusual         
OL,7,GChristmas gift - surgery to repair her 
OL,8,Gmalformed nose.                        
OL,10,FMango needs the treatment because one  
OL,11,Fof her nostrils is not connected to    
OL,12,Fher airways, making it a "cul-de-sac". 
OL,14,FThe young British Shorthair is         
OL,15,Fcurrently under the care of Holly's    
OL,16,FMerry Moggies, an independent cat      
OL,17,Frescue centre in Nottingham that       
OL,18,Fspecialises in caring for disabled     
OL,19,Fcats.                                  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
