OL,4,CI got hooked on dodgeball and now I    
OL,5,Ccoach England                          
OL,6,GJennifer Allam discovered the sport of 
OL,7,Gdodgeball at a Freshers' fair event in 
OL,8,G2012 and has never looked back.        
OL,10,FThe 35-year-old moved to Derby as a    
OL,11,Fstudent, and has stayed in the city    
OL,12,Fever since.                            
OL,14,FSince then, she has co-founded Derby   
OL,15,FPhantoms Dodgeball Club, which has     
OL,16,Fmembers travelling to Bangkok next     
OL,17,Fmonth for the Dodgeball World          
OL,18,FChampionships.                         
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
